section__
  @title "A489-CH11-Order-Check"
  @textPacing "cinematic"
  @shot "close"

  "Asha. The meeting room — the abandoned classroom on the third floor, tonight. Emergency protocol. You activated the coin because the intelligence from Draco's bathroom conversation changes the operational picture."

  "You report: the cabinet is complete. The passage is open. The target is confirmed as Dumbledore. The timeline is imminent — weeks, possibly days."

  "Asha listens. Takes notes in the self-destructing shorthand."

  "'The key,' she says. 'You said you located it. Is it still there.'"

  "'The containment is broken. The key is accessible.'"

  "'Then retrieval becomes priority one. Before the cabinet opens and the Room becomes contested ground.'"

  "She writes a name on a piece of parchment. Slides it across the table to you."

  "'A name to watch,' she says. 'Someone on the staff who has been behaving — inconsistently. We're not sure what it means. But if the cabinet opens and Death Eaters enter the castle, this person's behaviour suggests they may have prior knowledge.'"

  "You look at the name."

  rel_order = adjRel(rel_order, 10)
  knowledge = adj(knowledge, 5)

  choice__
    @target "A490-CH11-Order-Name"
    "The name."
  __choice
__section


section__
  @title "A490-CH11-Order-Name"
  @textPacing "cinematic"
  @shot "extreme_close"

  "The name on the parchment. A staff member. Someone whose behaviour has been noted — the specific inconsistencies that intelligence professionals call 'indicators.'"

  "You file the name. Cross-reference it with your own observations. The investigation's web grows more complex with every thread."

  "Asha's final instruction: 'Retrieve the key. Bring it to me. The Order will secure it through adult channels — the Hog's Head relay, Aberforth, the full chain. The key needs to be out of Hogwarts before the cabinet opens.'"

  "The assignment is clear. The retrieval will happen in Chapter 12."

  courage = adj(courage, 5)

  choice__
    @target "A495-CH11-Track-Convergence"
    "The Order assigns."
  __choice
__section


section__
  @title "A491-CH11-Dark-Check"
  @textPacing "cinematic"
  @shot "close"

  "Draco. The corridor. The conversation after the bathroom — you find him, or he finds you. The geography of complicity."

  "'I know you heard,' he says. No preamble. 'Myrtle told me someone was outside the door. She described your footsteps. She's very specific about footsteps — she's been listening to them for fifty years.'"

  "You don't deny it."

  "'My mother,' he says. 'That's the lever. That's always been the lever. Everything else — the Dark Lord's displeasure, the family's fall, the social consequences — I could bear. But my mother.'"

  "'What do you need.'"

  "'I need the key. The artefact. If I can deliver it alongside the — the primary objective — it changes the equation. The secondary objective completed. My mother's safety more assured. The Dark Lord has a prize beyond the primary target.'"

  "He's asking you to give him the Mirror-key. The key whose true function he doesn't understand. The key that, in Voldemort's hands, might not do what Voldemort expects — but that in Draco's hands, as a bargaining chip, could buy his mother's life."

  "You don't answer yet. The decision can wait for Chapter 12."

  rel_draco = adjRel(rel_draco, 10)
  cunning = adj(cunning, 5)

  choice__
    @target "A492-CH11-Dark-Delivery"
    "The request."
  __choice
__section


section__
  @title "A492-CH11-Dark-Delivery"
  @textPacing "cinematic"
  @shot "close"

  "The delivery Draco mentioned in Chapter 10 — the task his handler assigned through him. A package to be moved from the Room of Requirement to the Owlery. Not the key — something else. A component. A message. The logistics of an operation that is now operational."

  "You help him. The package is small, wrapped in dark cloth, sealed with a charm you don't recognise. You carry it through the castle — the specific, careful walk of two students who are carrying something they shouldn't be carrying to a place they shouldn't be going."

  "The Owlery. The package goes out. A large barn owl — not a Hogwarts owl, one that was waiting — takes it south."

  "The moral cost of participation is: present. Noted. Filed alongside the other costs."

  "But the proximity continues to yield intelligence. You now know the delivery schedule, the owl routing, the specific logistics of the Death Eater communication chain inside Hogwarts. Information that, depending on how this ends, could be turned to other purposes."

  morality = adj(morality, -5)

  choice__
    @target "A495-CH11-Track-Convergence"
    "The delivery is made."
  __choice
__section


section__
  @title "A493-CH11-Solo-Check"
  @textPacing "cinematic"
  @shot "close"

  "The solo investigator. The castle's intelligence picture, assembled from both sides without belonging to either."

  "You sit in the library. Late. The full picture laid out — not physically, not anymore; you've learned that physical evidence is vulnerability. The picture is in your head now, organised with the specific mental architecture that six months of solo investigation has built."

  "The picture: cabinet complete. Death Eaters incoming. Target: Dumbledore. Secondary objective: Mirror-key. Key location: confirmed. Key containment: broken. Key nature: intent-based amplifier."

  "The solo advantage: you see everything. The Order's movements. Draco's deterioration. The spy's aftermath. The staff's preparations. The castle's ward modifications. All of it flowing through your intelligence picture without the filter of allegiance."

  "You begin building the solo plan. The plan for what happens when the cabinet opens — your plan, answering to no one, constrained by no one's operational protocols."

  "The plan requires the key. But not for the Order and not for Draco. For you."

  knowledge = adj(knowledge, 8)
  cunning = adj(cunning, 5)

  choice__
    @target "A494-CH11-Solo-Plan"
    "The plan takes shape."
  __choice
__section


section__
  @title "A494-CH11-Solo-Plan"
  @textPacing "cinematic"
  @shot "close"

  "The solo plan. First draft. Contingent on variables you can't fully control — Draco's timeline, Dumbledore's presence, the staff's preparedness — but structurally sound."

  "Step one: retrieve the key. Before the cabinet opens. Before the Room becomes contested."

  "Step two: when the Death Eaters enter, use the chaos to move. Not to fight — fighting is what people with backup do. To position. To be where the key needs to be, doing what the key needs to do."

  "Step three: depends on what you've learned by then. The fifth journal section — Avery's coordinates. If Avery is alive, the plan extends. If not, the plan contracts."

  "The plan is: cold. Efficient. The specific efficiency of someone who has removed the emotional variables from the equation."

  "Whether the emotional variables stay removed when the actual moment comes — the solo investigator's recurring uncertainty."

  choice__
    @target "A495-CH11-Track-Convergence"
    "The plan waits."
  __choice
__section


section__
  @title "A495-CH11-Track-Convergence"
  @textPacing "cinematic"
  @shot "medium"

  "All three tracks converge. The allegiance check-in is complete. Each path has yielded its specific intelligence and its specific cost:"

  if__ (allegiance_track == "order") {
    "Order: a name to watch. A retrieval assignment. The network fully mobilised."
  }

  if__ (allegiance_track == "dark") {
    "Dark: Draco's request for the key. A delivery completed. The complicity deepening."
  }

  if__ (allegiance_track == "solo") {
    "Solo: the plan. Cold. Efficient. Alone."
  }

  "All paths share the same horizon: the cabinet. The key. The convergence that is weeks away."

  choice__
    @target "A496-CH11-Weight"
    "The weight settles."
  __choice
__section


/* ── 11f: CHAPTER CLOSE (A496–A500) ── */

section__
  @title "A496-CH11-Weight"
  @textPacing "cinematic"
  @shot "wide"

  "End of May. The castle's end-of-year rhythms continue — examinations, Quidditch, the social machinery of a school that functions regardless of what's happening underneath."

  "But you carry more now. The journal's fourth section. The Mirror-key's true nature. Draco's deterioration. The allegiance's operational demands."

  "The weight is: specific. Not the vague anxiety of earlier months — the precise, structured weight of someone who knows things and must decide what to do with the knowing."

  choice__
    @target "A497-CH11-End-State"
    "State of play."
  __choice
__section


section__
  @title "A497-CH11-End-State"
  @textPacing "cinematic"
  @shot "close"

  "End of Chapter 11. State of play:"

  "The journal: four sections decoded. The Mirror-key's nature revealed — intent-based amplifier, not weapon. Understanding required, not just possession."

  "The key: containment broken. Still in the Room of Hidden Things. Retrieval pending."

  if__ (dark_arts_practiced == true) {
    "Dark Arts: practised. The Shattering Curse. The magical signature marked. The line crossed."
  }

  if__ (romance_active != "") {
    "The romance: tested. The tension phase — the lies confronted, the truth offered or withheld or deferred."
  }

  "Draco: deteriorating. The cabinet complete. The Death Eaters coming. His mother the lever."

  "The timeline: weeks. Perhaps less."

  choice__
    @target "A498-CH11-Chapter-Close"
    "Chapter 11 closes."
  __choice
__section


section__
  @title "A498-CH11-Chapter-Close"
  @textPacing "cinematic"
  @shot "wide"

  "Chapter 11. The Secret at the Heart of Things. The secret was: the Mirror-key is an amplifier of intent. Not dark or light — intent. The holder's genuine purpose, magnified."

  "Which means: the key is only as dangerous as the person holding it. And only as powerful as what that person is willing to sacrifice."

  "Avery understood this. Avery encrypted this understanding because the wrong people knowing it makes the key more dangerous, not less. If Voldemort understood that the key requires genuine sacrifice, he might find someone willing to provide that sacrifice. As long as he thinks it's simply a power amplifier, his own inability to sacrifice anything real protects everyone else."

  "The secret at the heart of things is: love and violence use the same instrument. The difference is the hand."

  choice__
    @target "A499-CH11-Buffer"
    "Forward."
  __choice
__section


section__
  @title "A499-CH11-Buffer"
  @textPacing "cinematic"
  @shot "wide"

  "June approaches. Examinations. The Quidditch Cup. The end-of-year machinery. And underneath it all: the cabinet, the key, the war that is about to arrive inside the castle's walls."

  "The retrieval. The midwinter revelations. The hearts and hexes of the people you've let in."

  "All of it coming."

  choice__
    @target "A500-CH11-To-Ch12"
    "Chapter 12."
  __choice
__section


section__
  @title "A500-CH11-To-Ch12"
  @textPacing "cinematic"
  @shot "wide"

  "The castle holds its breath. You hold yours with it."

  "Chapter 12: Midwinter Revelations."

  choice__
    @target "A501-CH12-Midwinter-Opens"
    "Turn the page."
  __choice
__section
